            "heading": "Safe Practices",
            "heading_not_h2": false,
            "icon": "lock",
            "content": "<p><strong>Before first use:</strong> Test the housing empty, or with tissue or paper inside, to check the seal.</p><p><strong>Before entering the water:</strong> Make sure the seal area is clean and the case is fully closed and locked.</p><p><strong>After saltwater use:</strong> Rinse with fresh water and allow it to dry fully before storage.</p><p><strong>For smaller phones:</strong> Use the included foam support to help position the phone correctly inside the housing.</p><p><strong>Important:</strong> Waterproof performance depends on correct sealing, proper closure, ongoing care, and keeping sand, hair, dust, or debris away from the sealing area.</p>",
